Error: Jet.CopyNotSupported: `Ticket` can't be copied
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/move_only_copy_is_refused.jet:11:44
    |
 11 | copy_value: fn(ticket: Ticket) -> Ticket { ticket.copy() }
    |                                            ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Ticket` is `#MoveOnly`: its values move and never copy
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`; a second one has to come from wherever this one came from
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CopyNotSupported

Error: Jet.CopyNotSupported: `Holder` can't be copied
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/move_only_copy_is_refused.jet:13:45
    |
 13 | copy_holder: fn(holder: Holder) -> Holder { holder.copy() }
    |                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Holder` holds field `ticket`, a `#MoveOnly` `Ticket`, which moves and never copies
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`; a second one has to come from wherever this one came from
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CopyNotSupported
